{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the world of <strong>ABSTRACTICA</strong>, where geometric shapes have gone rogue, and the emptiness is <i>all-consuming</i>. Traverse this vast void on your quest to collect mosaic pieces in an attempt to... well just to <strong>create</strong>! Because what sense is there in existing, when your only task is to <i>destroy</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this third person shooter with roguelike elements, you fight your favourite geometric shapes like <i>Triangles</i>, <i>Parallelograms</i> and even <i>Hexagons</i>, in order to progress and unlock abstract pieces of potentially beautiful art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between <u>Dark Mode</u> and <u>Light Mode</u>, to change the dynamic of the run on the fly, because who knows... Maybe a change of scenery has an effect on your fighting ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your weapon with a variety of cubes that will give you the ability to shoot<strong> harder</strong>, jump <strong>higher</strong> and be (a little more) <strong>indestructible</strong>. As your art collection grows, you can also unlock <i>attachments</i> to your mask, each with a <strong>unique functionality</strong> that makes every adventure into the void memorable.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3571580?t=1744033596","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3571580?t=1744033596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/c5a78c9595e6dcd36d7e007adcd8e26b5c416906/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744033596","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/c5a78c9595e6dcd36d7e007adcd8e26b5c416906/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744033596","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the world of <strong>ABSTRACTICA</strong>, where geometric shapes have gone rogue, and the emptiness is <i>all-consuming</i>. Traverse this vast void on your quest to collect mosaic pieces in an attempt to... well just to <strong>create</strong>! Because what sense is there in existing, when your only task is to <i>destroy</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this third person shooter with roguelike elements, you fight your favourite geometric shapes like <i>Triangles</i>, <i>Parallelograms</i> and even <i>Hexagons</i>, in order to progress and unlock abstract pieces of potentially beautiful art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between <u>Dark Mode</u> and <u>Light Mode</u>, to change the dynamic of the run on the fly, because who knows... Maybe a change of scenery has an effect on your fighting ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your weapon with a variety of cubes that will give you the ability to shoot<strong> harder</strong>, jump <strong>higher</strong> and be (a little more) <strong>indestructible</strong>. As your art collection grows, you can also unlock <i>attachments</i> to your mask, each with a <strong>unique functionality</strong> that makes every adventure into the void memorable.</p>","developers":["Marciman Game Creations"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/054c994621292d7347d2b40a07562155a9f5ef83/header.jpg?t=1744033596","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121830,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121830/movie480.mp4?t=1743690755","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121830/movie_max.mp4?t=1743690755"},"name":"Main Trailer Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121830/8e4e2d99986d33696b62a890c1acffb7f815e011/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743690755","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121830/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743690755","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121830/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743690755"}}],"name":"ABSTRACTICA","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Marciman Game Creations"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/26c58001350f5628bb1c8b329902ba4088efd2d8/ss_26c58001350f5628bb1c8b329902ba4088efd2d8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744033596","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/26c58001350f5628bb1c8b329902ba4088efd2d8/ss_26c58001350f5628bb1c8b329902ba4088efd2d8.600x338.jpg?t=1744033596"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/247e2e3168b4a15799e8a0ccbd5b7f538772c672/ss_247e2e3168b4a15799e8a0ccbd5b7f538772c672.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744033596","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/247e2e3168b4a15799e8a0ccbd5b7f538772c672/ss_247e2e3168b4a15799e8a0ccbd5b7f538772c672.600x338.jpg?t=1744033596"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571